<title>SINGAPORE: Ong &amp; Co buys 28 million Heshe shares.</title>
<headline>Ong &amp; Co buys 28 million Heshe shares.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Retailer and garment manufacturer Heshe Holdings Ltd said on Wednesday Ong &amp; Co Pte Ltd had acquired 28 million shares in a private placement for a total consideration of Singapore $11.2 million.</p>
<p>The company said the purchase on November 29 represented about 9.86 percent of its issued capital.</p>
